# Optional. Origin of a game deployed outside this app: /<slug>/* is then proxied to it.
# Read at BUILD time (Next freezes rewrites into the build), not at runtime.
# Leave empty when the hosting already serves the game under /<slug> (cPanel Node.js app with
# Application URL "ludo"), and in local development set it to the game's dev server.
GAME_ORIGIN_LUDO=
